## Project structure
 
```
pdf-chatbot/
  backend/
    main.py          # FastAPI app + CORS
    ingest.py        # PDF → chunks → FAISS index
    retriever.py     # question → top matching chunks
    chat.py          # Groq API call with context
    routes/
      upload.py      # POST /upload
      ask.py         # POST /ask
  frontend/
    index.html
    style.css
    app.js
  data/
    uploads/         # uploaded PDFs
    index/           # FAISS index files
  .env
  requirements.txt
```
